ic","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-05-17T22:07:28Z","updated_at":"2024-05-17T22:07:28Z","body":"@nick1989Gr Can you share an example of a source code project that is using this license?\r\n\r\nLooking at the examples given (System.Threading.Tasks and System.Reflection), it looks to me like the nupkg files contain DLLs and XML files, but not actual source code. I should stress that I am very, very much not a .NET programmer, so apologies if I've got this wrong  :)\r\n\r\nUnder the SPDX [License Inclusion Principles](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/main/DOCS/license-inclusion-principles.md), SPDX does not list licenses that are intended as single-vendor, binary-only EULAs, which is what this one is currently looking like to me. While it does permit redistribution of the packages, things like the prohibition on reverse-engineering or attempting to derive the source code suggest to me that it's essentially a binary EULA.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2118436381/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2121950815","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2428#issuecomment-2121950815","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2428","id":2121950815,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85-emZf","user":{"login":"nick1989Gr","id":34338768,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MzM4NzY4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34338768?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick1989Gr","html_url":"https://github.com/nick1989Gr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick1989Gr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick1989Gr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick19